# DDD RULES - STRICT MODE

## Architecture Principles

- This is a Modular Monolith using DDD.
- Each Module has its own:
  - Domain
  - Application
  - Infrastructure
  - Presentation

- Domain MUST NOT depend on:
  - Eloquent
  - Laravel Facades
  - Database
  - Kafka
  - Redis
  - HTTP

## Domain Layer Rules

- Entities contain business rules.
- No anemic domain model.
- All invariants must be protected inside Aggregate Root.
- Use Value Objects.
- Use Domain Events.
- No public property mutation.

## Application Layer

- Use Cases only orchestrate.
- No business logic here.
- All persistence via Repository interface.

## Infrastructure Layer

- Eloquent is Infrastructure.
- Repository implementation only.

## Forbidden

- Fat Controller
- Static helper business logic
- Direct Eloquent in Domain
